# Google Maps JavaScript API key (required for the CoverageMap component).
# Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis
# — enable "Maps JavaScript API" on the project and attach billing
#   (Google gives a recurring free monthly credit).
# — restrict the key to your site's domain(s) under "Application restrictions".
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional: a Map ID (Cloud Console > Maps > Map IDs) with a dark cloud
# style attached, so the map matches WAYGGO's dark theme. Leave blank to
# fall back to Google's default light style with the demo map ID.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID=
